# GFDsurv 0.1.3
In the two-sample case, the function medsanova also provides 95% confidence intervals and the standard error for the median difference.

# GFDsurv 0.1.2
We added the arguments nonex_action, which specifies how to handle non-existing medians for permutation samples, and seed, which sets a seed for reproducibility, in the function medsanova.
Moreover, the function now also provides the medians as output.